background:
  color: $paper
  type: solid
pageType: content
notes: 目标与非目标
elements:
  - bounds: [64, 38, 400, 16]
    content:
      style: $kicker
      text: PART 01 · WHAT
      wrap: false
    elementId: kicker
    elementType: text
  - bounds: [64, 60, 832, 40]
    content:
      style: $title
      text: 先划边界：做什么，不做什么
      wrap: false
    elementId: title
    elementType: text
  - bounds: [64, 108, 832, 1]
    elementId: rule
    elementType: shape
    fill: {color: $line, type: solid}
    shapeName: rect
  - bounds: [64, 134, 200, 18]
    content:
      style: $kicker
      fontSize: 10
      text: 目标 · v1.0 必须做到
      wrap: false
    elementId: label-do
    elementType: text
  - bounds: [64, 162, 396, 256]
    elementId: box-do
    elementType: shape
    fill: {color: $beige, type: solid}
    shapeName: rect
  - bounds: [82, 178, 360, 226]
    content:
      style: $body
      fontSize: 12
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>· 支持 Excel / PDF / 扫描件 / 图片 / 文本 五类输入</p>
        <p style="margin-top:8px">· 提取 9 个字段：物料、规格、数量、单价、金额、单位、交期、付款方式、备注</p>
        <p style="margin-top:8px">· 按物料对齐多家报价，输出比价总表</p>
        <p style="margin-top:8px">· 异常自动标色 + 低置信度标黄，供人工复核</p>
        <p style="margin-top:8px">· 批量处理一个文件夹，LLM 端点可配置</p>
    elementId: box-do-t
    elementType: text
  - bounds: [500, 134, 200, 18]
    content:
      style: $kicker
      fontSize: 10
      color: $orange
      text: 非目标 · 明确不做
      wrap: false
    elementId: label-dont
    elementType: text
  - border: {color: $line, style: solid, width: 1}
    bounds: [500, 162, 396, 256]
    elementId: box-dont
    elementType: shape
    shapeName: rect
  - bounds: [518, 178, 360, 226]
    content:
      style: $body
      fontSize: 12
      color: $gray
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>· 不做供应商主数据管理、历史价格库（v2.0）</p>
        <p style="margin-top:8px">· 不做自动发询价邮件、不接 ERP / SRM</p>
        <p style="margin-top:8px">· 不做税率 / 汇率 / 运费的总价精算，只做数量×单价≈金额的合理性检查</p>
        <p style="margin-top:8px">· 不做合同、订单等其他单据类型</p>
    elementId: box-dont-t
    elementType: text
  - bounds: [64, 448, 832, 22]
    content:
      fontFamily: MiSans, MiSans
      fontSize: 14
      color: $ink
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p>边界写死在设计方案里防止范围蔓延，冒出来的新需求进 <span style="color:$orange"><strong>BACKLOG.md</strong></span>，不实现。</p>
      wrap: false
    elementId: bottom-line
    elementType: text
  - bounds: [64, 478, 560, 16]
    content:
      style: $small
      text: 技术分享 · 报价单提取比价工具
      wrap: false
    elementId: footer
    elementType: text
  - bounds: [860, 478, 36, 16]
    content:
      style: $mono
      fontSize: 12
      align: [right, top]
      text: '06'
      wrap: false
    elementId: page-num
    elementType: text
